 gni:`<div class="rule"><b>Add or subtract:</b> rewrite over a common denominator, then combine the numerators.</div><div class="rule"><b>Multiply:</b> top × top, bottom × bottom. <b>Divide:</b> keep, change, flip: a/b ÷ c/d = a/b × d/c.</div><div class="ex">2/3 + 1/4 = 8/12 + 3/12 = 11/12<br>2/3 ÷ 4/5 = 2/3 × 5/4 = 10/12 = 5/6</div><p>Always reduce at the end by dividing top and bottom by their greatest common factor.</p>`,
